-- | Base class for user-defined callbacks invoked by datamunge functions.
--
-- Derive from this class and override @call()@ to supply custom behavior wherever a @Callback\*@ is accepted.
--
-- The C++ class @datamunge::Callback@.
--
-- Create an extended object ('extendCallback') to implement its virtual methods in Haskell.
