-- Throws t'R.CppError' ('R.InvalidArgument') for C++ @std::invalid\_argument@: For any other extension (e.g. @.jpg@).
--
-- Throws t'R.CppError' ('R.NativeError') for C++ @std::runtime\_error@: If the file cannot be opened for writing, the plot has no data series, or the canvas is smaller than its margins.
