-- __References__
--
-- * J. W. Tukey (1977). Exploratory Data Analysis. Addison-Wesley. (Box plot and the 1.5 IQR fences.)
-- * R. McGill, J. W. Tukey, W. A. Larsen (1978). \"Variations of Box Plots\". The American Statistician 32(1), 12-16. doi:10.1080\/00031305.1978.10479236
-- * R. J. Hyndman, Y. Fan (1996). \"Sample Quantiles in Statistical Packages\". The American Statistician 50(4), 361-365. doi:10.1080\/00031305.1996.10473566 (quantile type 7.)
-- * R @boxplot()@: https:\/\/stat.ethz.ch\/R-manual\/R-devel\/library\/graphics\/html\/boxplot.html
-- * R @boxplot.stats()@: https:\/\/stat.ethz.ch\/R-manual\/R-devel\/library\/grDevices\/html\/boxplot.stats.html
