-- * R @qqline()@: https:\/\/stat.ethz.ch\/R-manual\/R-devel\/library\/stats\/html\/qqnorm.html
-- * R. J. Hyndman, Y. Fan (1996). \"Sample Quantiles in Statistical Packages\". The American Statistician 50(4), 361-365. doi:10.1080\/00031305.1996.10473566
--
-- __Warning:__ Only to\_svg() and @.svg@ saves draw reference lines. The raster outputs (@.png@, @.pdf@, and show()) currently omit them.
--
