-- Throws t'R.CppError' ('R.InvalidArgument') for C++ @std::invalid\_argument@: For fewer than two nodes, wrong coefficient\/u0 lengths or nonpositive\/nonfinite time controls.
--
-- Throws t'R.CppError' ('R.LengthError') for C++ @std::length\_error@: If frame counts, vector capacities or total scalar count cannot be represented.
--
-- Throws t'R.CppError' ('R.ArithmeticError') for C++ @std::overflow\_error@: If rounded time products cannot advance before t\_end.
--
-- Throws t'R.CppError' ('R.AllocationError') for C++ @std::bad\_alloc@: If output\/assembly storage cannot be allocated; callback exceptions propagate.
