-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- DelaunayTrace

-- | Complete owned sites, earliest-identity mapping, finite mesh and actual events. Numeric coordinate equality coalesces duplicates and signed zeros. Representatives retain earliest input indices in input order. Seed is the first two distinct sites and first later noncollinear site; remaining distinct sites are inserted in input order. Strict positive incircle conflicts retain an existing diagonal on an exact cocircular tie; permutations may therefore select another valid mesh. Final finite triangles rotate their smallest id first and are lexicographically sorted, independent of map\/hash traversal. All-collinear\/fewer than three distinct sites have no seed, faces or insertion events. All fields own data; public edits are unchecked and independent calls share no mutable state.
