kalmanFilterCovariance _self = R.call 1053 [R.object _self] P.>>= R.result

-- | Predict then correct every observation in order, owning actual posterior states. Empty input returns empty and leaves state unchanged. Ends at the final posterior, so repeated calls continue this instance rather than restarting. O(T) dense filter steps plus O(T\*n^2) owned output; input remains unchanged. A later invalid measurement can follow already committed predictions\/updates; failure does not roll the whole sequence back.
