kalmanFilterFilter _self _x1 = R.call 1054 [R.object _self, R.toCpp _x1] P.>>= R.result

-- | Execute one actual forward pass and an RTS backward pass on the full sequence. Owns actual prediction\/posterior arrays during execution, then returns causal and smoothed means\/covariances. No repeated-prefix runs. Leaves this filter at its final forward posterior. Empty input returns empty unchanged. Exact-model conditional covariance reduces; realized error need not decrease on every sequence. Ordinary matrix arithmetic can lose symmetry\/PSD. O(T) dense steps\/backward solves, O(T\*n^2) intermediate\/output storage.
