-- | Run PSO from the supplied point using the configured finite budget. Box-constrained particle swarm with global or ring attraction and constant or linearly decayed inertia. Coordinates seed one clamped particle; returns the best visited feasible point. Stops after more than twenty small-best-improvement iterations or its budget. O(population\_size\*p) storage; no global-optimality certificate.
