-- Throws t'R.CppError' ('R.InvalidArgument') for C++ @std::invalid\_argument@: PSO::optimize: population\_size must be at least 2; PSO::optimize: topology must be \'global\' or \'ring\'; PSO::optimize: inertia\_strategy must be \'constant\' or \'linear\_decay\'.
