-- | An owned B-rep solid with value-returning modelling and export operations. Geometry uses doubles in caller-selected consistent units. Copies own topology; immutable surfaces may be shared. Operations return new solids, preserving inputs. Unsupported kernel operations throw std::runtime\_error with the kernel diagnostic. Concurrent const access is safe; do not mutate a shared object concurrently.
