descartesSignChanges _x1 = R.call 7 [R.object _x1] P.>>= R.result

-- | Upper bound on the number of NEGATIVE real roots of p, via Descartes\' rule applied to p(-x) (same even-gap caveat as descartes\_sign\_changes()).
