-- | Generate the report\'s seeded uniform square-cloud control in the core. Uses mt19937(seed) and uniform\_real\_distribution\<double\>(0,extent), x then y for each point. Same-library runs reproduce the original report\'s seed20250728 and 30-site square when defaults are used. Standard distribution algorithms need not match across C++ libraries, so the seed is not a universal byte fixture. Coincident draws are allowed and later triangulation deduplicates them. O(count) work\/storage, owned output, no global RNG or shared mutation.
