delaunayUniformCloudWithMaxPoints _x1 _x2 _x3 _x4 = R.call 124 [R.toCpp _x1, R.toCpp _x2, R.toCpp _x3, R.toCpp _x4] P.>>= R.result

-- | Builds a structured rectangular mesh on \[x0, x1\] x \[y0, y1\]: nx \* ny grid cells, each split into two counterclockwise triangles, for a total of nx/ny/2 triangles and (nx+1)\*(ny+1) nodes, ordered row-major (x fastest, then y). Throws std::invalid\_argument if nx or ny is 0, or if x1 \<= x0 or y1 \<= y0.
