makeRectangularMesh2d _x1 _x2 _x3 _x4 _x5 _x6 = R.call 125 [R.toCpp _x1, R.toCpp _x2, R.toCpp _x3, R.toCpp _x4, R.toCpp _x5, R.toCpp _x6] P.>>= R.result

