makeMesh2dFromPoints _x1 = R.call 126 [R.toCpp _x1] P.>>= R.result

-- | Node indices lying on the mesh\'s outer boundary: every node incident to a boundary edge (an edge belonging to exactly one triangle). Works generically for both a structured rectangular mesh (the domain\'s four sides) and an unstructured Delaunay mesh (the convex hull), returned in ascending order with no duplicates.
