convexHullAnalyze
  :: [Point2D]  -- ^ Finite original records; not mutated.
  -> P.IO ConvexHullAnalysis  -- ^ Owned hull, earliest original indices and actual counters.
convexHullAnalyze _x1 = R.call 131 [R.toCpp _x1] P.>>= R.result

-- | Execute the same exact-sign hull kernel with identities and actual work. Same ordering, degeneracy and complexity contract as convex\_hull(). Full finite validation precedes the complete max\_points cap and scratch allocation. No events or completed-chain snapshots are retained; event cap is ignored.
