pearsonCorrelationTestWithAlternative _x1 _x2 _x3 = R.call 205 [R.toCpp _x1, R.toCpp _x2, R.toCpp _x3] P.>>= R.result

-- | Pearson product-moment correlation test with Fisher-z confidence bounds.
