  -> Alternative  -- ^ TwoSided (default), Less or Greater for the odds ratio relative to one.
  -> P.IO HypothesisTestResult  -- ^ statistic=a, p\_value and estimate1=sample odds ratio a/d\/(b/c), not R conditional MLE; denominator zero gives infinity for positive numerator or NaN for 0\/0. No confidence interval.
fisherExactTest2x2WithAlternative _x1 _x2 _x3 _x4 _x5 = R.call 208 [R.toCpp _x1, R.toCpp _x2, R.toCpp _x3, R.toCpp _x4, R.toCpp _x5] P.>>= R.result

-- | One-sample Kolmogorov–Smirnov test against a supplied continuous CDF.
