  -> [P.Double]  -- ^ Nonempty finite independent second sample.
  -> Alternative  -- ^ TwoSided (default), Less or Greater for first-versus-second stochastic location.
  -> P.IO HypothesisTestResult  -- ^ statistic=U=rank\_sum(x)-n\_x(n\_x+1)\/2 and approximate p\_value; no CI or location estimate.
wilcoxonRankSumTestWithAlternative _x1 _x2 _x3 = R.call 227 [R.toCpp _x1, R.toCpp _x2, R.toCpp _x3] P.>>= R.result

-- | Construct an owned B-spline basis for repeated evaluation with eval(). Free-function spelling of Bspline: construction fixes the knots and boundaries without evaluating a design matrix or fitting a model. The returned value owns its basis; the input knot vector may be modified or destroyed after this call.
