  -> P.IO Bspline  -- ^ Owned Bspline with the same degree, intercept policy and validation as its constructor. Call eval() on training and prediction coordinates.
bs _x1 _x2 _x3 = R.call 228 [R.toCpp _x1, R.toCpp _x2, R.toCpp _x3] P.>>= R.result

